  "description": "Backend-for-Frontend for Authio: lets a browser SPA (React, Angular, Vue...) sign in with Authio without ever holding a token. Cookie + OpenID Connect (code flow, PKCE, RFC 9207 iss check), server-side sessions, refresh-token rotation with single-flight refresh, session liveness by introspection, login/logout/user endpoints, CSRF-protected local APIs and a YARP-based remote API proxy that attaches the user's token.",
